.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Renviron
## `data/cache/` -- excluding the whole trailing-slash pattern (as it read
## before 2026-09-15) silently defeats the negation below: git can't
## re-include a file inside an already-excluded directory. `data/cache/*`
## excludes its contents instead, which the negation can then override.
data/cache/*
!data/cache/.gitkeep
